00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:44.970 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
Aquella vez...

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:47.850 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
Ah... disculpa...

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:53.140 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
Si buscas la preparatoria Kitaharo, está por allá.

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:55.190 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
¡Gracias!

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:03.990 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
El sentimiento que sentí entonces...

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:08.490 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
