00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:13.710 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
Algún día, espero que te alcance.

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:25.520 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Sono sora ippai no kamihikouki gurai ni natte

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:25.520 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
Quiero ser un avión de papel para que el aire por el
cielo me eleve.

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:36.320 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Wakaranai sore ga kotae nan datte

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:36.320 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
Lo único que van a contestar es que no me pueden
entender.

00:21:36.510 --> 00:21:39.740 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
shabon tama tobosou

00:21:36.510 --> 00:21:39.740 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
Creen que soy como una burbuja de jabón,

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:48.110 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Sora made wa kitto todokanai uchi ni kowarechau

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:48.060 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
que aunque lo intente, no volará por un cielo azul.

00:21:48.510 --> 00:21:53.490 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Ima tada shiritai no eien ja nai

00:21:48.510 --> 00:21:53.530 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
En este momento me niego a creer

00:21:53.860 --> 00:22:01.390 line:5.8% position:50% size:90% align:center
Kono mama zutto mite itai kedo

00:21:53.860 --> 00:22:01.390 line:85.2% position:50% size:90% align:center
